Satoshi
Designed by Deni Anggara, published by the Indian Type Foundry (ITF).
Obtained from https://www.fontshare.com/fonts/satoshi

Licensed under the ITF Free Font License (FFL).
https://www.fontshare.com/licenses/itf-ffl

Summary of the FFL as it applies to this repository:

  - Free for both personal and commercial use.
  - May be embedded in and served from a website (self-hosted webfonts,
    which is what the .woff2 files here are).
  - May be redistributed as part of this project provided this notice is
    retained and the fonts are not sold on their own.
  - No modification of the font files themselves.

Only the 400 / 500 / 700 upright weights are vendored here — the weights this
site actually renders. Fontshare also publishes 300, 600, 800 and 900 plus
matching italics; fetch them the same way if a future design needs them:

  curl -s 'https://api.fontshare.com/v2/css?f[]=satoshi@400,500,700' \
    | grep -o "https\?://cdn\.fontshare\.com/[^']*\.woff2"

(The bulk zip endpoint, https://api.fontshare.com/v2/fonts/download/satoshi,
returns HTTP 500 — use the CSS API above instead.)
